  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Preview 5: Vulkan bounded coverage caching, conservative edge bins, packed winding, specialized compute pipelines, device-local inputs, direct BGRA framebuffer output and overlap-aware barriers. Real controls window P50 improved from 22.250 to 2.316 ms on the measured GTX 1050 Ti, versus CPU 2.067 ms; memory did not improve proportionally. Optional per-dispatch GPU timestamps and cache diagnostics. CPU/Direct2D/Vulkan Native AOT windows verified. Full API, native pixel equivalence and macOS GPU remain incomplete. See the Vulkan optimization report for hardware, quality failures and measurement limits.",
